<section class="privacy" id="privacy">
  <span class="eyebrow">06 / Some things are just for you</span>
  <h2>Your conversations<br />aren’t content.<br /><em>They stay yours.</em></h2>
  <div class="privacy-details">
    <p>Not a record of your whole day.<br />Just the moments you choose to keep.</p>
    <p>Your saved audio stays on your phone.<br />Turning speech into searchable words happens there, too.</p>
    <p>A little help remembering.<br />Not another thing to post.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="privacy-aside mono">The people you’re with matter, too. Let them know you’re listening and get their consent.</p>
</section>
